WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:06.880
Fry. Do you have to make such a racket? What
is that contraption?

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:11.630
It's a broom bender. Today's a big day, and I
want the place to look nice for Leela.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:19.590
Oh, just like the lovely black snow of Old
London.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:26.130
Hey, before Leila shows up and judges our
swinging bachelor lifestyle, we should have

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.090
one last cabbage fight. I got a crate of
really rotten ones.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:34.800
I don't know. Now that Leela's moving in, I kind
of want to show her-

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:35.820
Let me finish.

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:36.120
I want to

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.370
show her. Show her show.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.770
I want to.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:41.370
All right.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:42.390
That's it.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:43.410
Oh!

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:46.440
Whoa, oh, oh.

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:51.360
Hey, that's the vase I keep my cabbages in.

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:57.660
Wow. It's so much cleaner than the last time
I was here.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.250
Leela, come in.

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:01.310
Welcome to your new home.

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.910
Our new home.

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:08.590
Where should I put my things? I don't see a
dresser.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:11.470
Oh, let the judgment thing begin.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:15.190
Do you have any hangers? I can put my things
in this tiny closet.

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:17.110
That tiny closet is my room.

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:22.030
Also, we don't have any hangers, but we can
order some from Momazon.

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:25.990
Oh, yeah. They have all the top, slightly
misspelled brands.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:27.460
Ha! Hangers.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:30.670
I'll get five. No, wait. There's free
shipping on 1000.

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:34.810
Wow. Fast delivery.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:41.270
Let's also get a shoe caddy so we don't track
mud into the room.

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:43.880
Right. Don't want to get mud on the cabbages.

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:55.000
Hey, you aren't the only ones who live here.

